# Keep EAS upload lean: only ship what the mobile build needs.
# Other monorepo apps are irrelevant to EAS and bloat the tarball.
/apps/web
/apps/studio
/apps/admin-ui
/apps/server
/apps/agent
/apps/studio-agent-runtime

# Local native build outputs (regenerated by prebuild / gradle / xcode).
# These caused ENOSPC during `eas build` compress when android/app/build was included.
**/android/app/build
**/android/build
**/android/.gradle
**/ios/build
**/ios/DerivedData
**/.expo

# Common junk
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules/.cache
